# Test that url builtin is available in net.llt scope when included
# Verifies the fix where net.llt added --- uses: ["net"] so url/http2-session/http-request
# are injected into its evaluation scope. This test calls uri-origin with a Url created
# via the url builtin (accessed via [module "net"]) to ensure url is accessible.
# Note: --- uses: ["net"] is not processed by the direct eval path; use [module "net"] instead.

[include %libdir "net.llt"]
---
[%.uri-origin [call [get "url" [module "net"]] "https://example.com:443/path"]]
=== out
String("https://example.com:443")
